1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,920
M: Hello, Ms. Loomis.

2
00:00:01,675 --> 00:00:02,880
This is Brandon Carter calling.

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:05,860
The items you ordered from us on Monday have just arrived.

4
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:08,380
W: That's surprising news.

5
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:12,520
They weren't supposed to arrive until sometime next week.

6
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:20,240
M: One of our employees visited the warehouse this morning, so he picked up all the items and brought everything back in his truck.

7
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,500
W: Wonderful.

8
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,520
You even got the couch and armchair I ordered?

9
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:26,315
M: Of course.

10
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:31,360
If you're at home today, we can deliver the shipment to you anytime between two and six.

11
00:00:32,255 --> 00:00:33,780
W: I'll be home by five o'clock.

12
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:34,580
M: Great.

13
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:35,840
I'll make the arrangements.
